Package: directCareScenarios
Title: Shared Saved-Scenario Persistence for directCare Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared database access layer for saving, listing, and loading
    named scenario slots (3 per practice, per feature area) in the shared
    Postgres database used by both directCareAnalytics and directCarePlanner
    -- Launch Planner plan inputs, DCA Quick Calculator inputs, and DCA's
    full Upload -> Projections forecast snapshots. Consumers pass an
    already-open DBI connection (see directCareAuth::db_connect()) to every
    exported function.
License: Apache License (>= 2) | file LICENSE
Imports:
    DBI,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
URL: https://raborn-decision-sciences.github.io/directCareScenarios/
